ne/godot/pull/124003.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This PR cleans up the rendering state during shutdown to support reinitialization.\r\n\r\nThis is part of the Godot instance reinitialization support to LibGodot.\r\n\r\nThis means, that once every part is merged, it will be possible to start - stop - restart a Godot instance in the same process multiple times without restarting the process itself.\r\n\r\nDeveloped by [Migeran](https://migeran.com)\r\nSponsored by [Xibbon Inc.](https://xibbon.com).\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## References\r\n\r\nThis is the next part of the LibGodot feature.\r\n- Original feature: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90510\r\n- Merged first PR: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110863\r\n\r\nAll PRs in the reinitialization support PR set:\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123717\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123552\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123999\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124000\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124001\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124002\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124003\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124004\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124005\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124006\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123720","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124003/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https: